        "code": "# 60-Second Vocal Grounding Drill:\n1. Stand upright, drop your shoulders away from your ears.\n2. Inhale deeply into your lower abdomen (belly expands, shoulders remain completely still).\n3. On the exhale, make a deep, resonant humming sound: 'MMMM-HUUUMMM'.\n4. Feel the physical vibration in your chest plate and lips.\n5. YAWN WIDELY: A genuine yawn physically lowers the larynx and opens the pharyngeal airway.",
        "language": "text",
