        "title": "The First 15 Minutes: Emergency Channel Block",
        "description": "Cut off the attacker's access immediately to prevent secondary drained balances.",
        "code": "# Immediate Security Freeze Sequence:\n1. BLOCK CARDS & NET BANKING:\n   - Call your bank's 24/7 emergency toll-free number (printed on the back of any ATM card or official app).\n   - Choose the IVR option: 'Report Unauthorized Transaction / Block All Channels'.\n2. BLOCK UPI & SIM IF COMPROMISED:\n   - If your phone was compromised via screen-sharing apps (AnyDesk, TeamViewer, RustDesk): Disconnect Wi-Fi and pull out the SIM card immediately.\n   - De-register UPI from your mobile banking portal.",
