    "shortDesc": "Psychological de-biasing protocols: The Cold Hard Evidence Ledger, separating internal emotional noise from external competency, and running high-stakes salary conversations.",
    "summary": "Over 70% of high-achieving professionals suffer from Imposter Syndrome—the persistent, irrational conviction that their accomplishments are mere luck and that they will soon be 'exposed as a fraud'. This psychological distortion causes chronic under-earning, over-working without boundaries, and intense dread before executive meetings. This protocol replaces emotional insecurity with an undeniable mathematical Evidence Ledger and provides a script-exact framework to negotiate salary raises and senior titles.",
