        "stepNumber": 1,
        "title": "Construct the 'Cold Hard Evidence Ledger' (Kill the Feeling with Data)",
        "description": "Your emotional brain lies to you; numbers do not. Create a permanent ledger documenting every revenue gain, problem solved, compliment received, and metric improved over the last 12-24 months.",
        "code": "# The Evidence Ledger Template\nDate | Problem Encountered | Action Taken | Quantifiable Business Impact\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\nQ1   | System latency spiked | Optimized SQL queries & Redis cache | Reduced API latency by 42%\nQ2   | High customer churn   | Rewrote onboarding email sequences | Saved $48k annual recurring rev\nQ3   | Client escalation     | Coached junior engineer on fix     | Retained tier-1 enterprise account",
