        "code": "# 0.1Hz Baroreflex Cadence:\n1. Inhale through the nose smoothly for 4.5 seconds (belly expands)\n2. Exhale through pursed lips smoothly for 5.5 seconds (belly contracts)\n3. Total cycle = 10.0 seconds (6 breaths/minute)\n4. Repeat without pausing for exactly 10 minutes",
