        "code": "# Python ADR & Pre-Market Range Filter\ndef calculate_forex_adr(df_daily, n_days=20):\n    df_daily['range'] = df_daily['high'] - df_daily['low']\n    adr = df_daily['range'].tail(n_days).mean() * 10000 # in pips for GBP/USD\n    return round(adr, 1)\n\n# Average GBP/USD ADR is typically 95-130 pips",
