        "code": "# Clinical Liver Biomarker & Neuro-Repair Protocol:\n1. Core Biomarker Target Panel (Test at Month 1, Month 3, Month 6):\n   - ALT (Alanine Aminotransferase): Target < 30 U/L (reverses steatohepatitis).\n   - AST (Aspartate Aminotransferase): Target < 25 U/L (AST/ALT ratio < 1.0).\n   - GGT (Gamma-Glutamyl Transferase): Target < 20 U/L (the most sensitive biomarker of alcohol toxicity).\n2. Pharmaceutical-Grade Hepatoprotective Stack:\n   - Phosphatidylcholine (Polyenylphosphatidylcholine 900mg 2x daily): Repairs damaged hepatocyte membranes.\n   - NAC (N-Acetyl Cysteine 1200mg): Restores depleted cellular glutathione pools.\n   - Milk Thistle Extract (Siliphos 160mg phytosome): Inhibits lipid peroxidation in liver tissue.\n3. The 'HALT' Relapse Firewall:\n   - Never allow yourself to stay Hungry, Angry, Lonely, or Tired without immediate behavioral correction.",
