        "code": "Execute the clinical 4-Step protocol: Relabel, Reattribute, Refocus, and Revalue whenever an ego-dystonic spike or compulsive urge hits.\n\n1. STEP 1 - RELABEL: Identify the thought with brutal accuracy. Say out loud or firmly in mind: 'I do not have a dangerous desire/hazard; I am experiencing an intrusive thought. This is an OCD spike.' Call the monster by its true medical name.\n2. STEP 2 - REATTRIBUTE: Assign the biological fault to brain wiring: 'It's not me—it's my brain. My caudate nucleus and orbital frontal cortex are sending a false alarm glitch.' This separates your core moral self from rogue neurological noise.\n3. STEP 3 - REFOCUS: Shift your physical attention to a wholesome, productive, absorbing activity for at least 15 minutes without performing ANY compulsion (no mental checking, no Google searching, no asking family for reassurance). Play an instrument, do pushups, write code, or garden.\n4. STEP 4 - REVALUE: De-escalate the thought's importance: 'This thought has zero moral weight or predictive power. It is biological junk mail.'",
