        "hi": "सैलरी आते ही 50/30/20 फॉर्मूले से खातों में पैसा बांटें",
        "description": "Do not save what is left after spending; spend what is left after automated saving. Split every paycheck the second it hits your bank.",
        "code": "1. Calculate your Net Take-Home Pay (after tax and mandatory EPF/401k).\n2. 50% - NON-NEGOTIABLE NEEDS:\n   - Rent/Mortgage, Groceries, Utilities, Minimum Debt Payments, Basic Insurance.\n   - If Needs exceed 50%, downsize housing or eliminate car payments immediately.\n3. 20% - AUTOMATED WEALTH & DEBT ESCAPE:\n   - Immediately transfers on Day 1 to emergency fund or index funds / SIPs.\n4. 30% - GUILT-FREE WANTS:\n   - Dining out, travel, hobbies, entertainment, shopping.\n   - Transfer this exact 30% to Bank Account B (debit card only). When Account B hits zero, fun spending ceases until next month.",
