        "title": "Construct the 6-Month Untouchable Emergency Vault",
        "hi": "6 महीने का अभेद्य इमरजेंसी फंड तैयार करें",
        "description": "An emergency fund is not an investment for yield; it is an insurance policy that stops you from going into ruinous high-interest credit card debt.",
        "code": "1. Calculate bare-bones monthly survival cost (Rent + Basic Food + Utilities + Insurance). Multiply by 6.\n   - Example: Rs. 40,000 survival x 6 = Rs. 2,40,000 ($3,000).\n2. The 3-Tier Storage Architecture:\n   - Tier 1 (Instant 24/7 Access - 1 Month): In a high-interest savings account linked to an ATM debit card.\n   - Tier 2 (T+1 Liquidity - 3 Months): In an overnight/liquid mutual fund or multi-option bank FD (sweep-in facility).\n   - Tier 3 (2 Months): In ultra-safe short-duration treasury bills or sovereign gold bonds.\n3. The Strict Rule of Use: Medical emergencies, job loss, emergency car engine failure ONLY. Never for vacations, weddings, or phone upgrades.",
