        "code": "1. List all active debts: Balance, Minimum Monthly Payment, and APR Interest Rate.\n2. The Mathematical Debt Avalanche (Saves most money):\n   - Pay absolute minimum on all debts except the ONE with the highest interest rate (e.g. Credit Card 1 at 42% APR).\n   - Throw every single spare dollar from bonuses and savings at that top card until dead.\n   - Roll that entire monthly payment into the next highest interest loan.\n3. The Psychological Debt Snowball (Best for momentum):\n   - Pay off the smallest balance first (e.g. $500 balance), regardless of interest rate. The psychological win generates massive dopamine to tackle the larger balances.",
