    "summary": "To-do lists are graveyard lists where easy, trivial tasks crowd out deep, life-changing priorities. This executive time management system uses the 4-Quadrant Eisenhower Decision Matrix to ruthlessly eliminate time sinks, blocks unbreakable focus sessions on digital calendars, and eliminates task switching fatigue.",
