        "title": "Convert To-Do Lists into Defended Calendar Time-Blocks",
        "hi": "टू-डू लिस्ट छोड़ें और सीधे कैलेंडर में समय ब्लॉक करें",
        "description": "To-do lists create psychological anxiety because they don't account for the finite physics of time. Move every priority into a specific calendar box.",
