        "answer": "Yes, but with one critical rule: do not stand all day. The optimal scientific ratio is 45 minutes sitting followed by 15 minutes standing. Standing for 15 minutes boosts blood circulation, re-engages leg glute muscles, and eliminates mid-afternoon energy slumps."
