    "summary": "Every Linux user eventually encounters a frozen package manager holding database locks, boots into a terrifying 'grub rescue>' prompt after a dual-boot update, or gets locked out of services with 'Permission Denied'. This battle-tested system administration manual provides exact terminal one-liners to safely revive Linux systems without formatting.",
