        "description": "Fix web server 403 Forbidden errors and diagnose services that crash upon boot with detailed journal logs.",
        "code": "# 1. Recursive ownership fix (Set owner to current user or www-data):\nsudo chown -R $USER:$USER /var/www/html/\n\n# 2. Standard secure permissions (Directories: 755; Files: 644):\nsudo find /var/www/html -type d -exec chmod 755 {} +\nsudo find /var/www/html -type f -exec chmod 644 {} +\n\n# 3. Diagnose failing systemd services:\nsudo systemctl list-units --failed\nsudo journalctl -u nginx.service -xe --no-pager\n\n# 4. Reload daemon and restart service:\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\nsudo systemctl restart nginx.service",
        "language": "bash",
