        "code": "# Steam Cloud Save Rescue & Proton GE Installation:\n1. Resolving Steam Cloud Save Conflicts:\n   - NEVER click 'Upload to Cloud' or 'Download to this machine' blindly!\n   - Locate local physical save backup folder first:\n     C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\userdata\\<YourSteamID>\\<AppID>\\remote\n   - Compare timestamps: The larger file with the most recent local timestamp is almost always your true save. Make a manual backup copy on Desktop before confirming!\n2. Install Proton GE for Steam Deck / Linux Gaming (Bypasses Video Codec Black Screens):\n   # In terminal or desktop mode:\n   flatpak install net.davidotek.pupgui2 # ProtonUp-Qt\n   # Open ProtonUp-Qt > Add version > Select latest 'GE-Proton'\n3. Enable Shader Cache Size Boost:\n   - In Steam Settings > Downloads > 'Shader Pre-caching' -> Toggle ON.\n   - Eliminates in-game micro-stutters during intense battle scenes.",
