        "description": "Chronic sexual performance anxiety is an autonomic nervous system dysregulation where anticipatory performance pressure triggers peripheral vasoconstriction via excessive noradrenaline. Retrain neural intimacy pathways with structured Sensate Focus and clinical biomarker testing.",
